eld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/23cbaaac6e2cca9622649fedefa2ee8e.poster.avif?t=1760419245\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/23cbaaac6e2cca9622649fedefa2ee8e.webm?t=1760419245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/23cbaaac6e2cca9622649fedefa2ee8e.mp4?t=1760419245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See through the chaos with <strong><u>X-ray</u></strong> vision!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/3530ebc3201bffba7dd4623067f78df7.webp?t=1760419245\" width=768 height=36 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan your defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/85fe7f84f945632dd0b3801c2618a3dc.avif?t=1760419245\" width=624 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place your defenses to counter a variety of enemy types, some charge headfirst, others are heavily armored, and each comes with its own unique behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/3530ebc3201bffba7dd4623067f78df7.webp?t=1760419245\" width=768 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to stop a mad scientist on a quest for world domination?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\